===========================================================================================
Sample Windows Security Event Log — Password Spray + Brute Force Scenarios
Sourcetype: WinEventLog:Security
Index:      wineventlog
===========================================================================================

HOW TO INGEST:
  1. In Splunk Web → Settings → Data Inputs → Files & Directories
  2. Upload this file, set sourcetype = WinEventLog:Security
  3. Or via CLI: splunk add monitor /path/to/windows-security-events.log -sourcetype WinEventLog:Security

===========================================================================================
